WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.266 --> 00:00:01.368 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Thanks to
newly developed technology,

00:00:01.368 --> 00:00:02.569 size:84% position:42%
we here at "Late Night"
now have the ability

00:00:02.569 --> 00:00:06.373
to record the tiny voice that is
inside Donald Trump's head.

00:00:06.373 --> 00:00:07.907 align:start size:94% position:6%
And you might be
surprised to know

00:00:07.907 --> 00:00:09.075 align:start size:94% position:6%
that like everyone's
inner voice,

00:00:09.075 --> 00:00:13.313
Donald Trump's is filled with
paralyzing fear and self-doubt.

00:00:13.313 --> 00:00:14.080 line:92%
So here it is, once again,

00:00:14.080 --> 00:00:18.051 align:start size:94% position:6%
the tiny voice in the back
of Donald Trump's head.

00:00:18.051 --> 00:00:22.589 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
♪♪♪♪

00:00:22.589 --> 00:00:24.424 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-Mr. President...

00:00:24.424 --> 00:00:25.025 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-Hey, Donald.

00:00:25.025 --> 00:00:26.860 align:start size:94% position:6%
It's the tiny voice
in the back of your head,

00:00:26.860 --> 00:00:32.365
and, oh, yeah, you are
in a minefield right now.

00:00:32.365 --> 00:00:33.666 size:88% position:44% line:92%
There are so many things

00:00:33.666 --> 00:00:35.502 align:start size:94% position:6%
that could go wrong
in this situation.

00:00:35.502 --> 00:00:37.504 align:start size:94% position:6%
Who looked
at this guy's outfit and said,

00:00:37.504 --> 00:00:40.640
"We should put him in
the same room as Donald J. Trump

00:00:40.640 --> 00:00:42.075 line:92%
and a bunch of reporters?"

00:00:42.075 --> 00:00:46.780 align:start size:94% position:6%
This is against every instinct
in your body to stand here,

00:00:46.780 --> 00:00:49.516 size:88% position:44%
not grab the microphone,
and point out everything

00:00:49.516 --> 00:00:51.384 align:start size:94% position:6%
that is different
about this person.

00:00:51.384 --> 00:00:55.889
[ Laughter ]
The hat, the robe, the beard --

00:00:55.889 --> 00:00:57.157 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
Oh, my God.

00:00:57.157 --> 00:00:59.993 align:start size:94% position:6%
You want to say something
about the beard.

00:00:59.993 --> 00:01:01.895 size:81% position:41% line:92%
You're gonna go crazy.

00:01:01.895 --> 00:01:05.265 line:92%
When is this gonna be over?

00:01:05.265 --> 00:01:09.302 align:start size:94% position:6%
Somebody get Dark Santa
outta here.

00:01:09.302 --> 00:01:10.570 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:01:10.570 --> 00:01:12.472 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Applause ]

00:01:12.472 --> 00:01:15.575 align:start size:94% position:6%
Hey, Donald, it's
the tiny voice in your head,

00:01:15.575 --> 00:01:18.945 align:start size:94% position:6%
and, oh, boy,
the tiny table is out.

00:01:18.945 --> 00:01:21.214 align:start size:94% position:6%
And you know what
the little table means.

00:01:21.214 --> 00:01:22.682 line:92%
It's time to sign your name.

00:01:22.682 --> 00:01:25.452 align:start size:94% position:6%
But don't do it so big
that you run out of paper.

00:01:25.452 --> 00:01:29.389
Oh, the big D and the O and the
N and the A and the -- Oh!

00:01:29.389 --> 00:01:30.490 line:92%
You're running out of paper.

00:01:30.490 --> 00:01:33.460 align:start size:94% position:6%
I hope you can fit it in --
Oh!

00:01:33.460 --> 00:01:34.494 align:start size:94% position:6%
You just made it.
[ Laughter ]

00:01:34.494 --> 00:01:36.563 align:start size:94% position:6%
And now show everybody
how proud you are

00:01:36.563 --> 00:01:38.364 align:start size:94% position:6%
'cause you signed
a piece of paper.

00:01:38.364 --> 00:01:41.835 align:start size:94% position:6%
This is the part
of the job you crush.

00:01:41.835 --> 00:01:43.436 size:88% position:44% line:92%
You're the best at this.

00:01:43.436 --> 00:01:44.471 size:75% position:38% line:92%
And now put it away.

00:01:44.471 --> 00:01:46.573 align:start size:94% position:6%
Oh, let's do another one.
[ Laughter ]

00:01:46.573 --> 00:01:49.109 line:92%
Let's do another one -- yep.

00:01:49.109 --> 00:01:50.610 align:start size:94% position:6%
Pretend like
you care what it says.

00:01:50.610 --> 00:01:56.850
Big D...little O, little N,
little A, little L, little D.

00:01:56.850 --> 00:01:57.650 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
Big old T!

00:01:57.650 --> 00:01:59.786 size:84% position:42%
Running out of paper.
Don't run out of paper.

00:01:59.786 --> 00:02:01.154 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
There we go.

00:02:01.154 --> 00:02:02.388 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
♪♪♪♪

00:02:02.388 --> 00:02:04.324 size:84% position:42% line:92%
[ Cheers and applause ]

